# Investigation Tools in Microsoft Sentinel

Microsoft Sentinel provides several capabilities that support investigations.

### Incident Details

Displays alert metadata, severity, owner, and status.

### Investigation Graph

Visualizes relationships between entities such as users, IP addresses, hosts, and alerts.

### Entity Pages

Provide historical activity associated with users, devices, or IP addresses.

### KQL

Allows analysts to validate detections, search historical events, and perform deeper analysis.

### Threat Intelligence

Enriches investigations with known malicious indicators.

Together, these tools help analysts move from a single alert to a complete understanding of the incident.

